      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i get what you're saying, but it doesn't really feel \"vital.\" it just feels heavy. like everyone has these big lives and connections, and i'm just... stuck here. if i just went away, it wouldn't even be a disturbance. people wouldn't even notice for weeks. it's almost like i'm already a ghost.",
